{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は\n沈金でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"℃-uteさんが来てくださいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/27/2521345/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌もダンスもうまくて可愛いのに\n面白かった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう無敵ですよね！至上最高のアイドルですよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださってありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/27/2521345/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週も沈金聴いてね～！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/27/2521345/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈金でも話が出ましたが\n今週のまいちゅんのANN0の\nモーニングゼミナールのコーナーに\n再び出演させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、中田がはまってるラッパーの方を\n紹介させていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/27/2521345/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フリースタイルだけじゃなくて\n楽曲が好きな方を3名選んだので\n良かったら聴いてみてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日、のぎ天です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/27/2521345/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて生放送の方に出られます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで、沈金とからじらーとかで\n出演できなかったから\n初めて出れるよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーは\nかりん、純奈、伊織、蘭世、みり愛 、中田です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生放送ならではの企画もあるから\nできれば生でよろしく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/27/2521345/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/27/2521345/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らんぜ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木中\n今夜も出演してまーす"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/27/2521345/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}